  partName: Blade17
  description: The Blade17 is a tiny, elongated blade situated at the middle-center-front
    position of the jet engine, responsible for further compressing air and increasing
    its velocity. Constructed from Blades texture material, its elongated shape allows
    for a larger surface area, enhancing its ability to manipulate airflow. Notably,
    the Blade17's front positioning enables it to handle the initial stages of air
    compression.
